  "ingredients": [
    "1 pint fresh strawberries, hulled and halved",
    "0.33333334326744 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Hull strawberries and cut them in half.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ixebCfBLkNlWEkK8EqtYEV1DRfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914-SupremeStrawberryTopping-mfs-Step1-0023-4x3-431091d63ddd41d0b661a7dee41e3ebe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine strawberries, sugar, and vanilla (if using) in a saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook, stirring occasionally, until mixture sizzles and juice begins to form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/53lDlF8WQSebcJNmXR3y7G0c1KE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914-SupremeStrawberryTopping-mfs-Step2-0028-4x3-9bba6852909e4d68a59f6d57ead844c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue stirring; mash a few strawberries with a wooden spoon or heat-proof spatula to help produce the syrup. Cook until sauce thickens, about 15 minutes. Remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ujHfMzth3B_sh2KUIOHGFf4eiyc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914-SupremeStrawberryTopping-mfs-Step3-0031-4x3-22778f9e1791457386a969ad46e5c7eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer 1/3 of the strawberry sauce to a blender. Cover and hold the lid down with a potholder while you puree the mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/b_9ooaR0pGUwfEeTaDf0cUldj6A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914-SupremeStrawberryTopping-mfs-Step4-0034-4x3-79287b742b384786bde52d3b0fc77c49.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add pureed mixture back into the remaining sauce and stir until blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sdDfMaFjQ1VOYWUkV0EOP6gH7WY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914-SupremeStrawberryTopping-mfs-Step5-0042-4x3-052ea967df14457b8dedc68ba12a8761.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve over a slice of cheesecake, ice cream, or you favorite dessert.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fDNIqKF0_TWO7d02-9gNFiVfFR8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/43914_Supreme-Strawberry-Topping-4x3-b70fc7fbf5a140e387a9a11e64f163a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/43914/step_06.webp"
    }
